Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.92,0:00:04.10,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Was that good?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.10,0:00:05.68,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.68,0:00:06.52,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.46,0:00:10.87,Usaghi Main,lady,0000,0000,0000,,It's all blurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.31,0:00:15.03,Usaghi Main,lady,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan, Kouki, stand side by side!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.35,0:00:16.49,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.80,0:00:18.19,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.64,0:00:22.61,Usaghi Main,lady,0000,0000,0000,,I'm taking it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.61,0:00:29.20,Usaghi Main,lady,0000,0000,0000,,Now, let's take a picture of you with Rin-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.20,0:00:31.09,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,No, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.09,0:00:32.66,Usaghi Main,lady,0000,0000,0000,,That won't do!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.66,0:00:34.86,Usaghi Main,lady,0000,0000,0000,,She'll be all grown up before you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.86,0:00:36.59,Usaghi Main,lady,0000,0000,0000,,You need to make memories while you still can.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.67,0:00:38.85,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.03,0:00:44.35,Usaghi Main,lady,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi-san, you're too tense!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.80,0:02:46.01,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Jeez!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.82,0:02:55.35,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, how many times do I have to tell you not to wander around alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.35,0:02:56.51,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.76,0:02:59.98,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You're a big girl now, so shape up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.98,0:03:01.24,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.56,0:03:03.91,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Don't give me that!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.91,0:03:06.70,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, can we get this as a snack?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.74,0:03:09.20,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,A snack?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.32,0:03:12.79,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Well, it looks tasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.92,0:03:18.21,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Haven't you ever eaten cereal before?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.21,0:03:19.16,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.62,0:03:22.10,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Is it too much for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.66,0:03:24.63,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I don't mind buying it,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.63,0:03:27.60,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,but it's something you eat for breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.08,0:03:30.40,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Is it okay to eat sweets with your meal?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.42,0:03:34.10,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,How can I put this? It looks like sweets,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.10,0:03:36.47,Usaghi Main,,0000,0000,0000,,but you can have it for breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.47,0:03:38.23,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You add milk to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.22,0:03:42.40,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Why don't you have that for breakfast tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.40,0:03:44.09,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I'll do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.09,0:03:46.02,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Will you have some too, Daikichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.02,0:03:48.80,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,No, that's not enough for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.64,0:03:52.82,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Put the cereal in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.06,0:03:59.10,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, you're bad at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.10,0:04:01.34,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,My hands are too dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.34,0:04:02.73,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,You're like an old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.73,0:04:03.99,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not an old man yet!{Was: Be quiet![lit: I still have a long life ahead]}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.99,0:04:05.65,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, let's see you do it then.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.31,0:04:13.55,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, there are cherry blossoms over there, so let's go this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.55,0:04:14.31,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.22,0:04:17.65,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,They're blooming everywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.65,0:04:19.27,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,That's because of the warm weather.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.78,0:04:23.87,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.87,0:04:25.24,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's in full bloom.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.68,0:04:28.74,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Since you just got into grade school,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.74,0:04:30.74,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,how about we plant something to commemorate it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.74,0:04:31.70,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Commemorate?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.22,0:04:34.62,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's like making a memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.57,0:04:39.83,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Year after year, both you and the tree will grow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.83,0:04:41.13,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.29,0:04:44.03,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I have a tree too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.03,0:04:45.34,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Near our house?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.34,0:04:46.55,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Back in my hometown.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.81,0:04:50.40,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,When I was born, my parents planted a fragrant olive tree,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.40,0:04:53.13,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,and for Kazumi, they planted a sweet olive tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.36,0:04:55.81,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Is a fragnant olive tree the one that smells nice?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.81,0:04:56.73,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.11,0:04:59.06,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know what a sweet olive tree is, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.38,0:05:03.87,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,The sweet olive tree is pretty plain when it comes to flowers or fragrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.87,0:05:07.20,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,She'd rip the flowers off my tree while yelling,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.20,0:05:09.66,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,"It's not fair that only yours smells good!"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.09,0:05:11.87,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,When I said I'd be willing to trade,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.87,0:05:14.13,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,she said, "I don't need a second-hand tree!"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.47,0:05:20.34,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, that's sort of a bad memory, so why am I trying to do the same for her?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.16,0:05:25.88,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,A tree with nice flowers would be better, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.88,0:05:27.28,Usaghi Main,,0000,0000,0000,,And we can watch it grow. {MISSING LINE. TLC -mushu}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.28,0:05:28.84,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'd like a loquat!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.86,0:05:30.93,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,A loquat?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.40,0:05:33.07,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah! A loquat!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.86,0:05:39.60,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I have a few loquat seeds.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.60,0:05:41.19,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You're going to plant them?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.32,0:05:44.13,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I can eat as many loquats as I want!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.13,0:05:45.65,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Only if you take good care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.16,0:05:50.82,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I was thinking of planting a tree that's as tall as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.82,0:05:52.08,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,So we can't get a loquat?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.12,0:05:56.83,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It grows a lot slower than other plants like the morning glory.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.52,0:05:58.51,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You know the proverb?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.51,0:05:59.83,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,"Peaches and chestnuts take three years..."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.51,0:06:03.90,TL Note,Proverb,0000,0000,0000,,TL Note: This proverb basically means, it takes time to see the results of hard work. {TLC}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.83,0:06:01.25,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,"...and eight years for persimmons!"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.54,0:06:03.90,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,As expected of Grandpa's kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.90,0:06:05.06,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,What about loquats?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.42,0:06:06.72,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.27,0:06:09.99,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,but what are you going to do if it takes ten years or so?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.99,0:06:11.47,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I can wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.79,0:06:15.39,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,After that, you'll be more interested in fancy sweets and food.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.72,0:06:17.30,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I can't even imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.69,0:06:20.36,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi! Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.36,0:06:23.42,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,If we don't hurry, I'll have to wait even longer to eat them!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.42,0:06:25.15,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.46,0:06:29.22,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Is this enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.22,0:06:33.35,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. If you dig too deep, the shoot won't be able to grow out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.35,0:06:34.21,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.77,0:06:43.55,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You really {\i1}are{\i0} Grandpa's kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.55,0:06:45.63,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I hope it starts growing soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.83,0:06:46.83,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.75,0:06:50.88,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, do you know about ninjas?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.28,0:06:54.40,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. Kouki-kun wants to become one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.91,0:06:59.41,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's said that a ninja would jump over a hemp plant every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.41,0:07:01.79,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,As the tree would keep getting bigger,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.79,0:07:04.52,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,the ninja would be able to jump great heights.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.59,0:07:08.53,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Want to try the same thing with this loquat?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.36,0:07:10.54,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.91,0:07:15.20,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.87,0:07:19.10,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.10,0:07:20.40,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.40,0:07:24.58,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Say, how tall does a loquat tree grow?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.80,0:07:26.57,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,As big as this house?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.57,0:07:29.92,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.80,0:07:40.21,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go back inside now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.21,0:07:41.69,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Ten times more!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.58,0:07:47.35,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if it'll take root by tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.35,0:07:49.44,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Tomorrow would be too soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.01,0:07:52.40,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You have all your stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.88,0:07:57.55,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,My timetable.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.55,0:07:59.75,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'm supposed to get someone from home to check it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.10,0:08:02.21,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Sounds annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.03,0:08:06.31,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I don't remember doing all this as a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.70,0:08:08.00,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.00,0:08:10.26,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It says, "Please confirm."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.26,0:08:14.18,Usaghi Main I,,0000,0000,0000,,{Not sure if these need to be translated. TLC -mushu}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.89,0:08:17.02,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,A fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.02,0:08:18.82,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Sounds like a police car.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.82,0:08:20.04,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,An accident, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.27,0:08:21.38,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.70,0:08:25.69,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, attach this whistle to my bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.66,0:08:32.44,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.75,0:08:37.78,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,If a stranger starts talking to you, you need to blow into this really hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.78,0:08:38.51,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.51,0:08:41.54,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,And any house is fine, so just go and hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.54,0:08:42.28,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.28,0:08:43.81,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Even a shop will do!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.81,0:08:44.66,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.87,0:08:56.38,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin! What about school?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.70,0:08:58.85,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, wake up quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.85,0:09:00.71,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to be late!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.25,0:09:02.10,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.59,0:09:04.18,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you for the food.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.21,0:09:04.56,Usaghi Main Top,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you for the food!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.11,0:09:06.92,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You need to add milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.92,0:09:09.44,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Can I have a little without milk?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.72,0:09:10.90,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.37,0:09:18.36,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Pet dogs eat this kind of stuff, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.36,0:09:20.17,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,They eat dog food!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.17,0:09:21.68,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's made for dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.68,0:09:23.07,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.07,0:09:24.46,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.46,0:09:27.37,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,People shouldn't eat food made for dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.59,0:09:31.22,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Don't look so disappointed about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.81,0:09:35.79,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Is it good?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.79,0:09:37.78,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, it's delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.78,0:09:39.87,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Rice balls are still number one, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.87,0:09:41.86,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You sure like rice balls, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.22,0:09:43.73,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, your phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.73,0:09:44.31,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'll get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.23,0:09:50.15,Usaghi Main,lady,0000,0000,0000,,G-Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.15,0:09:54.19,Usaghi Main,lady,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry. Kouki was all fired up, and he dashed out of the house!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.51,0:09:55.78,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Not a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.78,0:09:57.55,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,We're fine here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.72,0:09:58.71,Usaghi Main Top,kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.55,0:09:58.35,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.71,0:10:00.12,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.89,0:10:00.62,Usaghi Main Top,kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.12,0:10:01.23,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,He's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.32,0:10:06.13,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.80,0:10:09.71,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun, you've got burrs stuck to your clothes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.71,0:10:12.99,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What kind of animal path did you take to get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.99,0:10:14.46,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not an animal!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.69,0:10:17.09,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,And what's with your hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.09,0:10:18.96,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, go get a comb.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.96,0:10:20.47,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.65,0:10:27.06,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Your bag is all scratched!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.06,0:10:31.44,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You went around scraping that stick against people's walls, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.44,0:10:33.27,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Are you an esper?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.27,0:10:35.38,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You don't need to be one to figure that out!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.38,0:10:38.15,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Is that something you used to do too?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.90,0:10:40.61,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, go get ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.61,0:10:41.90,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.22,0:10:43.88,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What's with that look?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.89,0:10:49.49,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'm off!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.66,0:10:52.55,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Hang on for a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.55,0:10:53.29,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'll see you off...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.39,0:10:56.38,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.02,0:11:04.86,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun! You're not supposed to blow the whistle for no reason!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.56,0:11:07.26,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.11,0:11:09.48,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.48,0:11:11.02,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Stop blowing that whistle!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.53,0:11:14.40,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,People won't come help even if something {\i1}does{\i0} happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.72,0:11:16.95,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.33,0:11:18.90,Usaghi Main,kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.07,0:11:21.82,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Go on, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.15,0:11:24.14,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,We're off!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.85,0:11:29.07,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Watch out for cars!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.07,0:11:30.54,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.99,0:11:42.72,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.72,0:11:44.56,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.56,0:11:46.47,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,We're not supposed to stray from this route.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.47,0:11:49.47,Usaghi Main,kouki,0000,0000,0000,,It's not really straying. This is a shortcut!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.40,0:11:56.37,Usaghi Main,kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Ninjas take these kinds of paths!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.15,0:11:58.65,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Jeez.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.84,0:12:05.62,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's all wavy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.62,0:12:06.12,Usaghi Main,kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.01,0:12:28.68,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun, you're taking too long!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.24,0:12:31.41,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It defeats the point of taking a shortcut!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.13,0:12:38.54,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,That's not what you're supposed to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.00,0:12:52.25,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.72,0:13:13.83,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,He's an incorrigible kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.83,0:13:14.98,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.41,0:13:17.39,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Well, it happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.91,0:13:20.97,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Pretty much all boys are like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.97,0:13:22.55,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.51,0:13:26.77,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Ninja training should be limited to jumping over the loquat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.77,0:13:27.41,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.72,0:13:38.53,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, that loquat tree is a commemoration for starting grade school, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.53,0:13:39.38,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.82,0:13:45.84,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Your fragrant olive tree was a commemoration for your birth, so it's a bit different.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.08,0:13:50.26,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I guess I don't have a fragrant olive tree like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.81,0:13:53.26,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You're way too smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.89,0:13:57.34,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if her mother planted a tree or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.17,0:14:01.34,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe there's one at Grandpa's place.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.99,0:14:04.34,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, yeah. Grandpa might have.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.80,0:14:07.33,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You don't know if he did, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.56,0:14:08.41,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.37,0:14:13.74,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Grandpa's not around anymore, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.60,0:14:18.39,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,If I don't know, no one else would, would they?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.21,0:14:23.86,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I shouldn't have told her about the fragrant olive tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.08,0:14:27.61,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, you've got your elbows on the table again!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.61,0:14:29.13,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Right! Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.43,0:14:43.31,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.52,0:14:50.38,Usaghi Main,masako,0000,0000,0000,,I thought we wouldn't have to see each other again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.38,0:14:53.83,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I thought the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.00,0:15:00.54,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,This picture is from her entrance ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.92,0:15:01.92,Usaghi Main,masako,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.24,0:15:05.59,Usaghi Main,masako,0000,0000,0000,,A tree for Rin?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.12,0:15:10.80,Usaghi Main,masako,0000,0000,0000,,Actually, there is one!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.15,0:15:12.32,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,There is?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.32,0:15:15.97,Usaghi Main,masako,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I think there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.97,0:15:18.22,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Why are you so unsure?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.96,0:15:21.44,Usaghi Main,masako,0000,0000,0000,,Souichi-san was the one who planted it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.01,0:15:23.52,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Grandpa did?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.11,0:15:32.66,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'd like to replant that tree at my place.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.18,0:15:34.72,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What kind of tree is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.72,0:15:36.50,Usaghi Main,masako,0000,0000,0000,,It's a small one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.50,0:15:38.53,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Do you know what type it is
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.78,0:15:40.12,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,and where it's planted?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.35,0:15:43.56,Usaghi Main,masako,0000,0000,0000,,Let's see... It's pretty small,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.56,0:15:45.56,Usaghi Main,masako,0000,0000,0000,,and the branches are thin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.81,0:15:48.01,Usaghi Main,masako,0000,0000,0000,,It's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.87,0:15:52.90,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You {\i1}are{\i0} a manga artist, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.90,0:15:56.32,Usaghi Main,masako,0000,0000,0000,,My work doesn't consist of drawing maps!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.75,0:15:58.62,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Which way is north?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.62,0:15:59.52,Usaghi Main,masako,0000,0000,0000,,North?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.52,0:16:02.27,Usaghi Main,masako,0000,0000,0000,,Well, the sun rises in the west, so{\fscx250}-
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.79,0:16:03.77,Usaghi Main Top,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,That's wrong! It's the opposite!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.43,0:16:05.83,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Forget about the map.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.83,0:16:08.39,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Just write down where it is around the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.16,0:16:10.88,Usaghi Main,masako,0000,0000,0000,,I see. That'll work.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.14,0:16:16.20,Usaghi Main,masako,0000,0000,0000,,Well then, I have work to do, so I'll be leaving now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.46,0:16:17.53,Usaghi Main,masako,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you for the food.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.12,0:16:20.76,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry for disturbing you when you're busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.23,0:16:44.15,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if my tree is there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.64,0:16:48.43,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure Grandpa planted something for you, Rin-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.43,0:16:50.27,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,I have a feeling about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.79,0:16:52.52,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,Even if he didn't,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.52,0:16:56.24,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,you can plant another one, separate from your grade school one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.86,0:16:58.57,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,A tree for when you're six, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.36,0:17:00.20,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.46,0:17:02.73,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,You want to see Daikichi's tree?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.73,0:17:04.56,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.42,0:17:09.20,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's big!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.20,0:17:11.95,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, because Daikichi is thirty years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.95,0:17:14.80,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi has grown up too!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.91,0:17:17.51,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's a fragrant olive, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.51,0:17:19.99,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,Yes. How do you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.99,0:17:21.26,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.58,0:17:23.76,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,This one is Kazumi's tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.76,0:17:24.68,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,The sweet olive?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.02,0:17:25.95,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.86,0:17:32.47,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,You remember there was big tree in the garden behind Grandpa's house?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.47,0:17:33.90,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, what about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.91,0:17:43.17,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,That's my tree, a sweet olive.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.31,0:17:52.00,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? This tree...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.91,0:17:56.69,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,Grandpa planted it when I was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.25,0:18:05.73,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,You have the same tree as Kazumi-onee-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.06,0:18:07.37,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.35,0:18:13.03,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,I always compared our heights as a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.03,0:18:16.62,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,I liked it so much that I decided to do the same here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.50,0:18:20.45,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Was that a sweet olive tree?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.36,0:18:23.44,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Did Daikichi compare his height to the tree too?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.44,0:18:24.49,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.08,0:18:34.47,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Long before the day we first met...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.29,0:18:36.62,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.34,0:18:40.09,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It has the same leaves!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.97,0:18:43.04,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's a six-year-old fragrant olive.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.04,0:18:44.91,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,The same as mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.71,0:18:53.10,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,All done.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.77,0:18:55.42,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.42,0:18:56.67,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.67,0:18:59.08,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I can't jump over this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.67,0:19:02.24,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I don't think I can, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.83,0:19:26.15,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,We didn't even know about Rin half a year ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.15,0:19:27.54,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.79,0:19:31.34,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, we're going to miss the train!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.34,0:19:32.23,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.06,0:19:34.18,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Bye, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.69,0:19:36.21,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,I'll see you off.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.23,0:19:45.09,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Long before the day we first met,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.58,0:19:59.06,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,you were in the same flow of life as me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.78,0:21:41.06,Usaghi Main,kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.81,0:21:43.15,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.90,0:21:45.09,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.09,0:21:45.97,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What happened?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.97,0:21:47.76,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,There's a weird old guy outside!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.19,0:21:47.76,Usaghi Main Top,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.77,0:21:49.35,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.76,0:21:49.95,Usaghi Main Top,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,You're wrong. That person{\fscx250}-
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.95,0:21:51.41,Usaghi Main Top,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, you're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.01,0:21:51.41,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Where is he?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.75,0:21:54.83,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Jeez, just listen to me, both of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.47,0:21:57.75,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,That's Matsui-san, our neighbor!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.08,0:22:00.89,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Don't call him a weird old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.17,0:22:04.09,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm really sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.93,0:22:11.10,Usaghi Main,kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I'm... sor... ry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.45,0:22:16.97,Usaghi Main,matsui,0000,0000,0000,,I'm at fault too. I called out to them all of a sudden and probably startled them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.97,0:22:18.71,Usaghi Main,matsui,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.71,0:22:21.71,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Not at all. He was very rude to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.71,0:22:24.10,Usaghi Main,Matsui,0000,0000,0000,,Well, take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.33,0:22:25.78,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,We're off!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.73,0:22:33.07,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.72,0:22:38.00,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,When you ran away, you dragged Rin along.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.00,0:22:41.40,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,But he made a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.40,0:22:44.65,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,As long as Kouki is with you, I feel a bit at ease.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.97,0:22:46.20,Usaghi Main,kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Just a bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.20,0:22:47.40,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, just a bit!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.40,0:22:48.42,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You're still a little brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.42,0:22:50.15,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not little!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.44,0:22:54.69,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,We're going to be late.
